    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep below, in a darkened, rusting world. Humanity has been forgotten. Progress without progress. Those who should have preserved life destroyed it, and what remains is a broken reflection of the human form. Rusted pipes. Twisted wires. Menacing liquids bubble through the bodies of those who remain. They\u2019ve forgotten the meaning of things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you\u2019ve awakened, and the life in you draws them near. You must make your way through this industrial nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is your <i>Rusted Awakening.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/d61f8f0ba4c2d7392b267aa1b32d8848.webp?t=1745725902\" width=159 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/a246c0afd5b47e7737a878f9524569c9.poster.avif?t=1745725902\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/a246c0afd5b47e7737a878f9524569c9.webm?t=1745725902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/a246c0afd5b47e7737a878f9524569c9.mp4?t=1745725902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Weapons hit hard. Movement keeps you alive. Every shot matters. Every encounter is  brutal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/b85225457a3612199f5e4b905029cf7e.webp?t=1745725902\" width=147 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/f2037967afb8b3faa4cf65756d1fb505.poster.avif?t=1745725902\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/f2037967afb8b3faa4cf65756d1fb505.webm?t=1745725902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/f2037967afb8b3faa4cf65756d1fb505.mp4?t=1745725902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Distilled from the liquids of the dead, a powerful injection system lets you augment your abilities on the fly... but at what cost?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/ee07c5e9d46cc7aa5d140a1497cf845a.webp?t=1745725902\" width=107 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/692ef868b228d9f1c44edffe0570d964.poster.avif?t=1745725902\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/692ef868b228d9f1c44edffe0570d964.webm?t=1745725902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/692ef868b228d9f1c44edffe0570d964.mp4?t=1745725902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Face dark horrors born of progress: suicidal, drug-forged monstrosities and the remnants of failed experiments that should never have been.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/4154069a5b6232026dfe9e9c4d647edd.webp?t=1745725902\" width=188 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/718102eae96c76322ea735c5680d6e49.poster.avif?t=1745725902\" width=598 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/718102eae96c76322ea735c5680d6e49.webm?t=1745725902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/718102eae96c76322ea735c5680d6e49.mp4?t=1745725902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The world bends and warps with each step. Walls shift, corridors collapse, and reality itself distorts as the nightmare unfolds. Every step forward may be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep below, in a darkened, rusting world. Humanity has been forgotten. Progress without progress. Those who should have preserved life destroyed it, and what remains is a broken reflection of the human form. Rusted pipes. Twisted wires. Menacing liquids bubble through the bodies of those who remain. They\u2019ve forgotten the meaning of things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you\u2019ve awakened, and the life in you draws them near. You must make your way through this industrial nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is your <i>Rusted Awakening.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/d61f8f0ba4c2d7392b267aa1b32d8848.webp?t=1745725902\" width=159 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/a246c0afd5b47e7737a878f9524569c9.poster.avif?t=1745725902\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/a246c0afd5b47e7737a878f9524569c9.webm?t=1745725902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/a246c0afd5b47e7737a878f9524569c9.mp4?t=1745725902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Weapons hit hard. Movement keeps you alive. Every shot matters. Every encounter is  brutal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/b85225457a3612199f5e4b905029cf7e.webp?t=1745725902\" width=147 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/f2037967afb8b3faa4cf65756d1fb505.poster.avif?t=1745725902\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/f2037967afb8b3faa4cf65756d1fb505.webm?t=1745725902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/f2037967afb8b3faa4cf65756d1fb505.mp4?t=1745725902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Distilled from the liquids of the dead, a powerful injection system lets you augment your abilities on the fly... but at what cost?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/ee07c5e9d46cc7aa5d140a1497cf845a.webp?t=1745725902\" width=107 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/692ef868b228d9f1c44edffe0570d964.poster.avif?t=1745725902\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/692ef868b228d9f1c44edffe0570d964.webm?t=1745725902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/692ef868b228d9f1c44edffe0570d964.mp4?t=1745725902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Face dark horrors born of progress: suicidal, drug-forged monstrosities and the remnants of failed experiments that should never have been.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/4154069a5b6232026dfe9e9c4d647edd.webp?t=1745725902\" width=188 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/718102eae96c76322ea735c5680d6e49.poster.avif?t=1745725902\" width=598 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/718102eae96c76322ea735c5680d6e49.webm?t=1745725902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874490/extras/718102eae96c76322ea735c5680d6e49.mp4?t=1745725902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The world bends and warps with each step. Walls shift, corridors collapse, and reality itself distorts as the nightmare unfolds. Every step forward may be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
